  ProjectName: Melides Pottery Mupi
  ClientName: Grandola
  Tags: 96
  Texts:
  - category: 0
    info: Lead Developer.
  - category: 1
    info: "Gr\xE2ndola Municipality (C\xE2mara Municipal de Gr\xE2ndola)."
  - category: 2
    info: 'A set of short educational games for an interactive mupi (a public touchscreen
      kiosk), all centred on Melides pottery: a clay game, an info game and a word
      search.

      

'
  - category: 3
    info: 'The word search had to generate a new, valid puzzle every time, with words
      allowed to share letters where they cross.

      

'
  - category: 9
    info: 'I wrote a procedural word-search generator:

      - For each word, pick
      a random direction (horizontal or vertical) and a valid start position for
      the word''s length.

      - Walk the cells: each one must be empty or already
      hold the same letter, so words can cross.

      - If a placement fails, try
      a new position. After repeated failures, reset the grid and regenerate.

      -
      Size the grid slightly larger than the longest word, which makes resets very
      rare in practice.

      - Fill the remaining cells with random letters and
      render the grid.'
